      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pattonsburg%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pattonsburg lies in northwest Daviess County, just west of U.S. Route 69 and two miles west of Interstate 35.",
